{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "868310e193d1af0b9a0a16b18d5826a5490fe3f9410defa30dc115829fc1db4a", "ja": "なし", "zh": "无", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cec33cb47844574d8e8b0d14bc759b927749eb8c56264d40cf8aca6094aeb890", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，你辛苦了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "97df3775490ff5562bbb648caf7b3e20a1c261bb6affb580cd3bb0db6493ae84", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんっ！\nよかった、また社長さんがお呼びなんです。", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生！\n太好了，社长又有事情要找你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50895249b07ec792e1dd44174ac6a7e0d1b01d5f30ee557058c1089b640795ad", "ja": "そうですか。仕事の話かな……。\nわかりました、ちょっと行ってきますね。", "zh": "这样啊，会是工作的事情吗……\n我明白了，我这就过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8d5063b247d7f52da62c4754403f5a7a2682f44fae8490c0e2f151a2b8428a9", "ja": "はい、今日もお仕事、頑張ってくださいねっ！\nペンも忘れないでくださいね～♪", "zh": "好的，今天也要努力工作喔！\n也别忘记带笔啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3931728cb3661a50b9db78e7e980a7e59fb6af0642c02f7cbb4102299e65cc64", "ja": "はい……、はい？", "zh": "好……好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9b7226253b742d0f499e997f7d21e5e0ac22a2850d97ba1ef500a76b392040b3", "ja": "社長、失礼します……あれ？\n何か甘い匂いがするような……？", "zh": "社长，打扰了……咦？\n我好像闻到甜甜的味道……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1007_president", "source_sha256": "e4fd0abb0b7205822dfec32247bc4e7c8a3a00fa1dff0d6a74a43ab3527d7659", "ja": "やあ君、いいところに来たね！　ちょうど今、\n音無君がホットケーキを焼いてくれたところだ！", "zh": "哎呀，你来得正好！\n刚好音无煎了松饼呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "26de1af519e0e98f6b72d3dfc9d80b81c7079c89262f54b274638fd769071790", "ja": "満月のようにまんまるで、実に美味しそうだろう？\nたくさんあるから、食べながら話そうじゃないか。", "zh": "松饼就像满月一样圆，看起来真的很好吃，对吧？\n她做了很多，我们边吃边谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c6a96e1204b9c8eceea94e2ee71a8903869b85fa2b7a98784ac0d07f5fc90e18", "ja": "いいんですか？　じゃあ、遠慮なく。\n音無さん、ありがとうございます……音無さん？", "zh": "可以吗？那么我就不客气了。\n音无小姐，谢谢你……音无小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "9efccc2adf548fcdb0bf947b1d982fcf25f710c992c5036d93ec4cee89e951e9", "ja": "むむむむ……。2分の1……3分の2……\nいや、やっぱり4分の3……。", "zh": "唔唔唔唔……二分之一……三分之二……\n不，我看还是四分之三吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4f8e9dbbb03c258cb118e6a064df46baff96ed1bd8b6a70aca05f02b150166d5", "ja": "ど、どうしたんですか音無さん。\nホットケーキとにらめっこなんかして。", "zh": "你、你怎么了？音无小姐？\n为什么要瞪着松饼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "83e242273b6445d97a42737d9595e923e1f1f3ca4ae9cc881f3ef4181ea55d18", "ja": "音無君はね。……ダイエット中なんだそうだ。", "zh": "音无她说……她正在节食减肥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "7f0c42cfc2946e1ec00cbab4d69c6b6183023feca3cde953a81aa00a4199479d", "ja": "もりもり食べて、じゃんじゃん働いてくれた方が、\n私としてはうれしいのだが……。", "zh": "但我个人倒是希望她能多吃一点，\n这样才能努力工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "edeedfb7d3f809dda273d7e7f4232a6721090427d6b53ae1b3487624efb833d1", "ja": "社長～っ！　無責任なこと言わないでくださいっ。\nそういう甘い考えが、乙女のピンチをまねくんですっ！", "zh": "社长～！请别说这种不负责任的话！\n就是这种天真的想法，才会招致少女的危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "6685d63cd6ed3850d979afc406c553b95bb3d3441b6e824a13a164ec1c0f3348", "ja": "ああっ、やっぱりだめ！　ここは我慢よ！\n{$P$}さん、これ……半分どうぞっ！", "zh": "啊啊！还是不行！我要忍耐！\n{$P$}先生，这个……分你一半吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1f217f8c4c305e55f82aa24957914283ce9dbbfa77bc262bcecd39b1aa08ce5c", "ja": "えっ、半分もいいんですか？\nありがとうございます。いただきます！", "zh": "咦？要分我这么多吗？\n谢谢你，那我开动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "e9dfddb1a4fae42db1ca201f8562c323b83173e5dada922c6c6e86422c80e45a", "ja": "いえいえ、どうぞどうぞ♪\nやったわ小鳥……またひとつ煩悩に打ち勝ったわ……！", "zh": "不会的，尽管吃吧♪\n太好了，小鸟……你又战胜一个诱惑了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "061b5e7b44d5d261b737934a6a6e3fe32e0b76e0121da02ab76e5621bd4588fb", "ja": "うむ、音無君が乙女のピンチを脱したところで……\nそろそろ本題に入るとしようか。", "zh": "嗯，音无已经摆脱少女的危机……\n那我们也该言归正传了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "9880068e919279e8abd80db4d543d1647dc991d7ebdd67f18ba119a7a68b14ba", "ja": "今日来てもらったのは、他でもない。\nほら、君が以前出してくれた企画書……。", "zh": "今天我请你过来不为别的。\n还记得吗？你之前提出的企划书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "56a58fd8df4356b817dce5cb50092a574ae5345d72065b9dad7cb91ead78fbc5", "ja": "そう、天体をモチーフにした公演のことだ。\nあの企画を、さらに進めてもらいたいと思っている！", "zh": "没错，就是以天体为概念的公演。\n我想请你继续执行那个企划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "67f6a5b1da97f1362c5679c760bd3c5ddc886c910694a1100ee9ca54338cc313", "ja": "おお、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "喔喔，谢谢社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "c4debc24d60aee95bea3827680431730884ad515a63f92fe3b9362ab08631509", "ja": "第一弾の『Sunshine Rhythm!』も、\nとっても盛り上がってましたよね♪", "zh": "第一波『Sunshine Rhythm!』\n真是盛况空前呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "2afdab4fbced09a4bbf054ce4011227a000032e5024a24030461e98db1685dd5", "ja": "そして第二弾は、月をテーマにした\n『BlueMoon Harmony!』、だったかな？", "zh": "而第二波，是以月亮为主题的\n『BlueMoon Harmony!』，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "3e55276f94e4659d242375ca07f173fc870b136a2dc8223e9219b2bf9c941f27", "ja": "『Sunshine Rhythm!』に続く、\n大きな盛り上がり、期待してもいいかね？", "zh": "我可以期待这次也能延续『Sunshine Rhythm!』，\n带来盛况吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_1025", "source_sha256": "a1651805294af259915e2250129136ccfaa84b54a5d2226786e6f6457872d976", "ja": "してください！", "zh": "敬请期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1943b1092bef10a18160dfb23e6588120adba205433a2bf7b9a4d0bc9f65a902", "ja": "はい、期待してください！\n最高のステージを、みんなと作ってみせます！", "zh": "没问题，敬请期待！\n我会和大家一起打造出最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "b200036f9bca141699f9bae24a92580b1003b96125d628b9e628f2be557f7cda", "ja": "うむ！　青い月の名にふさわしい、凛とした\nアイドル諸君の姿を、私に見せてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯！让我见识偶像们\n展现不负蓝月之名的英姿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_2002_101kot", "source_sha256": "1ead98538a372b1c0e7b2e5fe4abcf41a5024b015fc8f897306eeaee8a850939", "ja": "ふふっ、月のように凛として、まんまるで……。\nまんまるな……ホットケーキ……。", "zh": "呵呵！就像月亮般凛然的英姿，圆圆的满月……\n圆圆的……松饼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "c98cea2f429db9a9a14336390e0c4075a2b4a031be946b43362adc95327a4033", "ja": "はっ、ダメ！　ダメよ小鳥！\n煩悩に惑わされてはダメ～！", "zh": "啊！不行！不行啊小鸟！\n不可以输给诱惑啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0052_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "ac2793d6897871236b178779c0de1d81e70dfe6247bb49af24286e8f6449400c", "ja": "（『月』という単語にも、色々なイメージがある。\n前回に負けない、いい公演にしよう！）", "zh": "（光是『月亮』这个词就给人许多不同的印象。\n努力打造出不输上次的出色公演吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
